  "evidencia": "Page: Zeitgeist (The Smashing Pumpkins album). Sentence: Zeitgeist is the seventh album by American alternative rock band The Smashing Pumpkins, released on July 10, 2007 in the United States and Canada.\nPage: Zeitgeist (The Smashing Pumpkins album). Sentence: The album was produced by Roy Thomas Baker, Billy Corgan, Jimmy Chamberlin, and Terry Date.\nPage: Jimmy Chamberlin. Sentence: He is best known as the drummer for the alternative rock band The Smashing Pumpkins.\nPage: Jimmy Chamberlin. Sentence: Following the 2000 breakup of the band, Chamberlin joined Pumpkins frontman Billy Corgan in the supergroup Zwan and also formed his own group, the Jimmy Chamberlin Complex.\nPage: FOL (song). Sentence: \"FOL\" is a song by The Smashing Pumpkins, written and recorded during the sessions for their 2007 album \"Zeitgeist\" and used for a Hyundai commercial during Super Bowl XLIII.",
