        "original_id": "c2bd5c12-0e3a-5e7c-a0c4-bd6e3e2ce4d4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jimmy Chamberlin, Billy Corgan, Roy Thomas Baker, Terry Date\n- Organizations: The Smashing Pumpkins, Zwan, Jimmy Chamberlin Complex, Hyundai\n- Products: Zeitgeist, FOL\n- Events: The Smashing Pumpkins breakup, Super Bowl XLIII\n\nFacts:\n- In 2000, after The Smashing Pumpkins broke up, Jimmy Chamberlin joined Billy Corgan in the supergroup Zwan and formed the Jimmy Chamberlin Complex.\n- Jimmy Chamberlin is best known as the drummer for The Smashing Pumpkins.\n- Zeitgeist is the seventh album by the American alternative rock band The Smashing Pumpkins.\n- Zeitgeist was produced by Roy Thomas Baker, Billy Corgan, Jimmy Chamberlin, and Terry Date.\n- Zeitgeist was released in the United States and Canada on July 10, 2007.\n- FOL is a song by The Smashing Pumpkins that was written and recorded during the sessions for the 2007 album Zeitgeist.\n- FOL was used in a Hyundai commercial during Super Bowl XLIII.",
